I stand in front of the building and look for Nele's name.
I find it quickly and ring the bell.
The door opens and I walk up the stairs.
Nele is already waiting for me at her door.
"Hello Maya, it is nice that you are here!" she says cheerfully.
She smiles and hugs me in greeting.
"Thank you for the invitation," I answer.
I hold the small cardboard box from the bakery carefully in my hands.
"I brought you something," I say and smile.
I give her the cardboard box with the fruit tart.
"Oh, how sweet!"
"I thank you," says Nele enthusiastically.
She looks excitedly at the cardboard box.
"I promise you that we will still eat this tonight," she laughs.
That makes me very happy.
"Come inside into the flat," Nele says and opens the door fully.
I step inside and take off my shoes.
Then I take off the backpack.
